---
layout: base.njk
title: Research | Bamford Lab
description: How the Bamford Lab studies antiviral immunity, across virology, evolution, drug design and AI.
permalink: /research/index.html
---

    <div class="container">
        <div class="page-head research-head">
            <div class="research-masthead">
                <h1>Research</h1>
                <p class="lead">Antiviral immunity is our central question: how cells and animals sense viral infection, switch on the interferon response and keep it in balance. We pursue it from four directions at once.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <section class="section" id="pillars" style="padding-top:1rem;">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="pillar-stack">
                {% for r in research.pillars %}
                <article class="pillar-card reveal" id="{{ r.slug }}">
                    <canvas class="pillar-canvas" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
                    <div class="pillar-card-head">
                        <h2>{{ r.title | safe }}</h2>
                        {% if r.lead %}<p class="pillar-lead">{{ r.lead }}</p>{% endif %}
                    </div>
                    <div class="pillar-body-grid">
                        <div class="pillar-text">
                            {% for para in r.detail %}
                            <p>{{ para }}</p>
                            {% endfor %}
                        </div>
                        <aside class="pillar-questions">
                            <h3>Questions we are asking</h3>
                            <ul>
                                {% for q in r.questions %}
                                <li>{{ q }}</li>
                                {% endfor %}
                            </ul>
                        </aside>
                    </div>
                </article>
                {% endfor %}
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- HOW IT FITS TOGETHER -->
    <section class="section section-alt" id="together">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="section-head reveal">
                <h2>How it fits together</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="together-copy reveal">
                <p>A typical project runs through several of these: an evolutionary signal points to a protein interface, virology tests what it does in a real infection, computation predicts which changes matter, and the best findings become targets worth designing against.</p>
                <p>Across all four runs a One Health view spanning wildlife, livestock and people, shaped by the COVID-19 pandemic, when members of the lab helped build Northern Ireland's genomic surveillance of the virus.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
